WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.100
Open the Loftwah Creative Archive.
Start with the Higher Than Before album cover.

00:02.100 --> 00:05.000
Compare the square cover
and the tall release poster.

00:05.000 --> 00:08.100
Use 100% to inspect the cover’s lettering
at original pixel size.

00:08.100 --> 00:11.700
Return to Fit. The centred mark stays readable
in the square album tile.

00:11.700 --> 00:14.600
Enable edit access for your local agent.
Codex uses the packaged Prints command.

00:14.600 --> 00:20.000
Keep both images and record the choice.
The portrait gives the release lettering more room.

00:20.000 --> 00:23.000
Reopen Prints and find the saved brief
and shortlisted images.

00:23.000 --> 00:27.300
Open Release Poster and choose Export original.

00:27.300 --> 00:30.000
The saved JPEG matches
the archive original byte for byte.
